== fm-waiting-on-you
1..12
ok - a turn end with no live captain hold shows Waiting on you: 0
ok - a live captain hold shows its count, title, and class, and a dated deferral does not count
ok - many live holds name three titles and count the rest
ok - an aged unanswered hold still counts and is marked with its hold date
ok - a registered secondmate makes the line say its holds are not counted
ok - an unreadable backlog shows unknown, never a false zero
ok - a home on a non-markdown backlog backend never prints a zero
ok - a crewmate or scout worktree prints nothing
ok - the registered Claude Stop hook shows the waiting line as its systemMessage, and only for Claude
ok - only the Claude Stop hook registry runs the waiting line among the tracked JSON hook registries
ok - a Pi turn end refreshes the footer status to the live waiting line, zero included
ok - a Pi read that finishes after a newer one does not put back its stale count
